card-description" class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Global market metrics, Fear and Greed, content, community trends, and broader market signals.</div></div></div></div>
<h2 class="group relative text-2xl font-bold" id="common-use-cases">Common use cases<a href="#common-use-cases" class="ms-[0.33em] rounded text-[0.8em] text-muted-foreground p-0.5 -m-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-50 hover:text-primary hover:opacity-100! transition-opacity duration-200 inline-flex items-center align-middle" aria-label="Link to common-use-cases"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link size-[0.75em] min-w-4 min-h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Build live price widgets, watchlists, and portfolio dashboards</li>
<li>Power ranked market views, screeners, and discovery experiences</li>
<li>Fetch historical data for charts, analytics, and backtesting</li>
<li>Monitor exchange activity, market pairs, and liquidity</li>
<li>Add DEX token, pair, and on-chain market data to your product</li>
<li>Combine market data with headlines, trends, and community signals</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="group relative text-2xl font-bold" id="start-here">Start here<a href="#start-here" class="ms-[0.33em] rounded text-[0.8em] text-muted-foreground p-0.5 -m-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-50 hover:text-primary hover:opacity-100! transition-opacity duration-200 inline-flex items-center align-middle" aria-label="Link to start-here"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link size-[0.75em] min-w-4 min-h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a></h2>
<div class="stepper"><ol>
<li>
<p><strong>Try it instantly - no key</strong></p>
<p>Call a curated set of endpoints with zero setup using the <a class="" href="/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/keyless-public-api" data-discover="true">Keyless Public API</a>. No account, no signup, no headers.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Set up your key</strong></p>
<p>When you&#x27;re ready for higher rate limits and the full catalog, follow <a class="" href="/api/documentation/guides/quick-start" data-discover="true">Get Started with an API Key</a> to get a key and make your first authenticated request.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Find your use case</strong></p>
<p>Use <a class="" href="/api/documentation/guides/common-workflows" data-discover="true">common workflows</a> or <a class="" href="/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/endpoint-overview" data-discover="true">choose an endpoint</a> to find the right starting point.</p>
</li>
</ol></div>
